# Private VM copies for the executed tests (see Arm64-readme.md). Kept outside
# build/ so a clean gate does not delete them, and never committed: they are
# ~50 MB of binaries that belong to the sibling repositories.
/vm/

# Keep extracted fixtures and expected-output files under tests/fixtures.
!tests/fixtures/**

# Handoff mailbox from the sibling VM repository
/inbox/
